    <tags>tina4 cli web-framework php python ruby nodejs scss dev-tools scaffolding</tags>
    <summary>Unified CLI for the Tina4 framework - Python, PHP, Ruby, and Node.js.</summary>
    <description>
The **Tina4 CLI** is one command for the whole Tina4 framework family. Scaffold a
project in any of four languages, run a hot-reloading dev server, generate models
and routes, run migrations, and measure code health - all from `tina4`.

Common commands:

* `tina4 setup` - guided project setup (language + AI tool + scaffold)
* `tina4 init &lt;language&gt; &lt;path&gt;` - scaffold a new project (python, php, ruby, nodejs, tina4js)
* `tina4 serve` - start the dev server (file watcher + SCSS + browser)
* `tina4 generate &lt;what&gt; &lt;name&gt;` - model, route, migration, middleware
* `tina4 migrate` - run database migrations
* `tina4 metrics` - report code-health top offenders
* `tina4 doctor` - check installed languages/tools and skills currency

This package downloads the official, EV-signed Windows binary from the project's
GitHub Releases and verifies its SHA-256 checksum before installing. See
tools\VERIFICATION.txt for how to verify it yourself.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/tina4stack/tina4/releases/tag/v3.8.83</releaseNotes>
